// AN ENGINE CEILING, PINNED FROM THE ENFORCING SIDE. §10.2 lets a macro's
// text use other macros and bounds nothing about how deep that goes. VerA
// expands at most 128 nested macros (docs/IMPLEMENTATION.md) and refuses the
// 129th with E0119, naming the limit. M130 below expands M129, and so on to
// M0: 131 levels. A macro that uses itself is a different error, E0118.
//
// Legal neighbour: any fixture using a macro from check.vh.
//
//! reject E0119
